        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/5988bbfec60bf1bfe3126e8c51591be7.avif?t=1785924261\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/1484d75900cb96956d4ea61b9219f023.poster.avif?t=1785924261\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/1484d75900cb96956d4ea61b9219f023.webm?t=1785924261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/1484d75900cb96956d4ea61b9219f023.mp4?t=1785924261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for a treasure-filled adventure beneath the waves! Merge coins and gems to uncover riches beyond imagination!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover maps that change how you play, each with its own unique shape and background. Can you master them all and merge the biggest treasure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/c592289d502a566ae1776f45b4190b9f.avif?t=1785924261\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/b2c637961171afc9291bbbaaebf0517d.poster.avif?t=1785924261\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/b2c637961171afc9291bbbaaebf0517d.webm?t=1785924261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/b2c637961171afc9291bbbaaebf0517d.mp4?t=1785924261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together locally inside one dome and collect points as a team! Merge treasures, grab power-ups, and try to reach the highest score side by side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERSUS mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge a friend locally! The dome is split in half - one side for you, one side for your opponent. If one player overfills their dome and items spill out, the other has only a few seconds left to score as many points as possible before the game ends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch amazing power-ups as they float to the surface and use them whenever you want:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bomb: Explodes and pushes everything away</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pearl: Merges with any treasure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ruby Curse: Makes treasure even more valuable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Eruption: Destroys all stones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Specter: Lets your treasure pass through obstacles</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Online leaderboards to show off your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Co-op mode to play and merge together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Versus mode to challenge your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 2 maps with unique shapes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 5 exciting power-ups that can change everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fully customizable name and character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Wide range of character skins: from underwater to out of this world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A bright and dazzling underwater look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swim to the top and rule the leaderboard!</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/5988bbfec60bf1bfe3126e8c51591be7.avif?t=1785924261\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/1484d75900cb96956d4ea61b9219f023.poster.avif?t=1785924261\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/1484d75900cb96956d4ea61b9219f023.webm?t=1785924261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/1484d75900cb96956d4ea61b9219f023.mp4?t=1785924261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for a treasure-filled adventure beneath the waves! Merge coins and gems to uncover riches beyond imagination!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover maps that change how you play, each with its own unique shape and background. Can you master them all and merge the biggest treasure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/c592289d502a566ae1776f45b4190b9f.avif?t=1785924261\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/b2c637961171afc9291bbbaaebf0517d.poster.avif?t=1785924261\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/b2c637961171afc9291bbbaaebf0517d.webm?t=1785924261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165470/extras/b2c637961171afc9291bbbaaebf0517d.mp4?t=1785924261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together locally inside one dome and collect points as a team! Merge treasures, grab power-ups, and try to reach the highest score side by side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERSUS mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge a friend locally! The dome is split in half - one side for you, one side for your opponent. If one player overfills their dome and items spill out, the other has only a few seconds left to score as many points as possible before the game ends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch amazing power-ups as they float to the surface and use them whenever you want:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bomb: Explodes and pushes everything away</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pearl: Merges with any treasure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ruby Curse: Makes treasure even more valuable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Eruption: Destroys all stones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Specter: Lets your treasure pass through obstacles</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Online leaderboards to show off your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Co-op mode to play and merge together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Versus mode to challenge your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 2 maps with unique shapes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 5 exciting power-ups that can change everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fully customizable name and character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Wide range of character skins: from underwater to out of this world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A bright and dazzling underwater look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swim to the top and rule the leaderboard!</strong></p>",
